# Keep the 2 GB dataset, the toolchains and the local environment out of the
# build context - the image mounts company data at run time instead.
.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.venv
**/.venv
scenario_intelligence_engine/new_data
scenario_intelligence_engine/data/uploads
scenario_intelligence_engine/frontend/src
scenario_intelligence_engine/frontend/node_modules
scenario_intelligence_engine/tests
release
deploy
*.md
*.pptx
*.mp4
*.png
